WEBVTT

00:14:27.533 --> 00:14:32.033
So the idea is really to have that focus,
so you can really contribute

00:14:32.033 --> 00:14:35.533
into the development 
of the future of the country.

00:14:35.852 --> 00:14:41.642
As you can see, those topics 
are heavily imported locally,

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:45.642
relevant locally, but they have 
a global impact too.

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:48.840
Everybody is worried about future energy,

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:53.250
everybody is worried about 
how you deal with cancer and diabetes,

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:54.470
and all of that.

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:57.843
And, of course, ICT is, needless to say,

00:14:57.843 --> 00:15:01.180
what's happening on the sphere 
of social networks